Package: cryptick-token-daemon
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cryptick Security Team <security@alphaseneca.com>
Depends: libc6, libudev1, libhidapi-hidraw0, pcscd
Description: Cryptick Token Host Daemon & OpenSSH Middleware
 Bridges Cryptick Token hardware across USB and Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE)
 to the host OS. Exposes CTAPHID virtual interfaces, OpenSSH sk-api middleware,
 PIV smart card virtual reader integration, and WebAuthn Native Messaging.
